meta {
  name: Get product by id
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  TICKET-P6-009 — fetch a product by its server-generated id. `:productId` must be a UUID
  (400 { code: 'invalid_product_id' } otherwise). Run "Lookup product by GTIN" first to populate
  `productId`.

  Response augmentation:
  - All products include unverified: boolean.
  - VERIFIED products: unverified: false.
  - PENDING_REVIEW products: unverified: true, plus a flat submission object, and submittedByUserId for registered callers.
  - Nutrition/ingredients sit under `packaged` (null for a CUSTOM product), never at the top level.

  Visibility (P5-007, via services/productVisibility.ts):
  - PENDING_REVIEW products are returned to every caller. The anonymous copy omits submittedByUserId — anonymous users cannot submit, and the field links a user UUID to content.
  - REJECTED products return 404 for every caller.
  - Voting stays registered-only: POST/DELETE /products/:productId/verify answer an anonymous token with 403.

  Errors: 400 (non-UUID productId), 404 (not found / REJECTED).
}
